    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Immerse yourself in Galway's rugged coastline and rest awhile in the charming seaside village of Carraroe on the Wild Atlantic Way. Discerning guests can enjoy luxury self-catering accommodation in one of our superb lodges, all within walking distance of Carraroe village with its restaurants, pubs and blue flag beaches. The bright, attractive open plan living spaces are designed to make your stay extra special\r\n\r\nNamed after the area's unique \"Coral Strand\" Carraroe hosts the Galway hooker Festival which is the most significant maritime event for these traditional fishing boats. Less than 40 minutes to Galway city, the village of Carraroe provides easy access to the Aran Islands and every nuke and cranny of Connemara."
      }
    ],
